Sweeping up non-criminal New Yorkers based purely on their skin color or native language is illegal, xenophobic, and in clear violation of the Fourth Amendment.

Our neighbors should not have to write emergency numbers on their arms just to go buy milk or pick up their kids from soccer.

@DHSgov cannot claim to protect the homeland while flagrantly violating our Constitution on our street corners.

