The Trump admin has shown time and time again a complete disregard for the rule of law.

Our legal system forbids a federal agency from acting as judge, jury, and executioner on a paper record alone. This is yet another blatant violation of the law.

@DHSgov doesn’t get to invent a fast-track deportation pipeline that completely trashes due process. Every person seeking asylum protection is here lawfully and has the right for their case to be heard.

